          %p
            This is discussed at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a{:href => "relative%20homology#RelativeHomologyOfCWComplexes"} Relative homology - Homology of CW-complexes
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_2 Remark
            %p
              Thus, each cellular differential
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
